---@field jobId? string Identifies the workflow job this WorkItem belongs to.
---@field initialReportIndex? string The initial index to use when reporting the status of the WorkItem.
---@field reportStatusInterval? string Recommended reporting interval.
---@field packages? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.PackageList Any required packages that need to be fetched in order to execute this WorkItem.
---@field streamingSetupTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.StreamingSetupTask Additional information for StreamingSetupTask WorkItems.
---@field leaseExpireTime? string Time when the lease on this Work will expire.
---@field mapTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.MapTask Additional information for MapTask WorkItems.
---@field projectId? string Identifies the cloud project this WorkItem belongs to.
---@field configuration? string Work item-specific configuration as an opaque blob.
---@field seqMapTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.SeqMapTask Additional information for SeqMapTask WorkItems.
---@field streamingComputationTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.StreamingComputationTask Additional information for StreamingComputationTask WorkItems.
---@field shellTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.ShellTask Additional information for ShellTask WorkItems.
---@field sourceOperationTask? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.SourceOperationRequest Additional information for source operation WorkItems.
---@field id? string Identifies this WorkItem.

---Information about an individual work item execution.
---@class gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkItemDetails
---@field endTime? string End time of this work item attempt. If the work item is completed, this is the actual end time of the work item. Otherwise, it is the predicted end time.
---@field attemptId? string Attempt ID of this work item
---@field startTime? string Start time of this work item attempt.
---@field metrics? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.MetricUpdateList Metrics for this work item.
---@field stragglerInfo? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.StragglerInfo Information about straggler detections for this work item.
---@field taskId? string Name of this work item.
---@field state? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkItemDetailsStateEnum State of this work item.
---@field progress? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.ProgressTimeseries Progress of this work item.

---@alias gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkItemDetailsList gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkItemDetails[]

