---@field workerMessages? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkerMessageList The WorkerMessages to send.
---@field projectId string The project to send the WorkerMessages to.
---@field location string The [regional endpoint] (https://cloud.google.com/dataflow/docs/concepts/regional-endpoints) that contains the job.

---@class gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkerMessagesProjectsRequest
---@field workerMessages? gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkerMessageList The WorkerMessages to send.
