---@field currentThreadCount? number Current number of active threads in a worker.

---Contains the thread scaling recommendation for a worker from the backend.
---@class gcp.dataflow_v1b3.WorkerThreadScalingReportResponse
---@field recommendedThreadCount? number Recommended number of threads for a worker.

